===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{m|gmh|tūbe}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|tūba|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*dūbǭ}}. Compare {{etyl|nds-de|-}} {{term|Duuv|lang=nds-de}}, Dutch {{m|nl|duif}}, English {{term|dove|lang=en}}, Danish {{m|da|due}}, Swedish {{m|sv|duva}}.

====Noun====
{{de-noun|f||Tauben|Täubchen}}

